BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 567.77 Tm (Treat the initial funnel as a testable planning model rather than an industry) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 552.55 Tm (benchmark. From 200 researched accounts, suppose 120 meet the signal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 537.32 Tm (definition, 60 meet timing and contact requirements, 24 produce substantive) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 522.10 Tm (two-way conversations, 12 supply sufficient evidence and qualify, and six sign) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 506.87 Tm (mandates. That is 60%, 50%, 40%, 50%, and 50% conversion between) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 491.65 Tm (successive stages, or 3% from raw account to signed mandate. The 40%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 476.42 Tm (conversation assumption is ambitious for purely cold outreach and requires) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 461.20 Tm (testing; warm introductions must be reported separately. Three wins from 200) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 445.97 Tm (accounts would be 1.5%; ten would be 5%. Define a commercial win explicitly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 430.75 Tm (as a signed mandate, then track accepted implementation and collected revenue) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 415.52 Tm (as different outcomes. During weeks one and two, build evidence and obtain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 400.30 Tm (partner schedules. During weeks three through six, run discovery and baseline) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 385.07 Tm (reviews. During weeks seven through twelve, close executable mandates and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 369.85 Tm (reconcile supplier acceptance. Some renewal calendars will exceed this window.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 354.62 Tm (Diagnose the stage that fails before increasing volume: poor conversations) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 339.40 Tm (suggest relevance problems; poor document return suggests trust or effort) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 63.00 324.17 Tm (problems; poor signatures suggest weak economics or unclear decision authority.) Tj ET
